cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this repository, please cite the archived software release using the DOI provided in its GitHub or Zenodo record."
type: software
title: "CAJO Edge AI Reproducibility Repository"
abstract: >-
  Research code, experiment configurations, deployment measurements, and
  supporting results for constraint-aware Edge AI configuration assessment
  across CIFAR-10, CIFAR-100, and Speech Commands. The experiments examine
  architecture selection, pruning, knowledge distillation, INT8 quantization,
  and accuracy-storage-latency trade-offs.
authors:
